{
  "config_version": "minimal-3",
  "review_policies": {
    "intent": [],
    "design-review": [],
    "plan-review": [],
    "implementation-review": [],
    "validation": [
      {
        "id": "intent-delivered",
        "description": "Validation evidence demonstrates intent outcomes and acceptance boundaries were delivered.",
        "example_prompt": "Judge intent-delivered only. Confirm validation report maps intent outcomes and acceptance evidence to observable proof, not merely completed work. Template: crates/software-change-provider/data/templates/validation-report.md. Schema: crates/software-change-provider/data/configs/minimal.json#/artifact_schemas/validation-report.json. Deny only a material defect plausibly affecting change success against intent; minor blemishes, style, length/count proxies, silence, and invented norms are not findings. Do not waive material finding. Materiality guard: silence is not a finding; check omissions only against the named acceptance/requirements set — do not hunt for unlisted omissions; do not invent norms; length/count proxies are not findings."
      }
    ]
  },
